      "marks": {
       "1": "Frame 1: the up throw",
       "8": "Frame {f}: {opp} is released, straight up or where its DI sends it",
       "FREE": "Frame {FREE}: Fox can act",
       "OVER": "Frame {OVER}: its hitstun is over: it jumps away"
      }
     }
    }
   },
   {
    "title": "Jump, and the up air",
    "text": [
     "X or Y on frame {FREE}, held for a full hop; when the opponent is high, a second jump in the air. The C-stick up as Fox closes in: the up air hits above him.",
     "With DI the opponent flies to one side. Dash after it for a few frames before the jump, and keep the stick toward it in the air."
    ],
